    "image_with_text_tqcmTp": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "subheading_dhVxan": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Decorate with Floating Candles Indoors and Outdoors",
            "subheading_tag": "h2",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-5-base"
          }
        },
        "border_b9HG8d": {
          "type": "border",
          "settings": {}
        },
        "text_hyBPrM": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Few elements elevate a space like the soft glow of floating candles. Indoors, they’re perfect in glass vases, shallow bowls, or water-filled trays placed on dining tables, window sills, or bathroom counters. Outdoors, they shine in pools and ponds, adding elegance to evening gatherings or private moments.</p><p>Unlike traditional candles that require holders, round floating candles create their own visual impact by gently drifting across the surface. Their movement adds dimension and interest, turning still water into a design feature. With no wires, no outlets, and no smoke, they're an effortless way to light up any space.</p><p>From formal receptions to relaxed dinners on the deck, our 1.75 and 3-inch floating candles bring warmth and sophistication without overwhelming the setting. Add a few florals or petals to the water, and you’ve created a professional-grade display in minutes.<br/><br/></p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "subheading_dhVxan",
        "border_b9HG8d",
        "text_hyBPrM"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "image_position": "left",
        "text_alignment": "left",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/floating-candles-in-bulk-photoaidcom-cropped.png",
        "aspect_ratio": "square",
        "focal_point": "image_presentation",
        "image_caption": "",
        "show_small_image": false,
        "image_small_aspect_ratio": "square",
