    "image_with_text_qTFEGA": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "subheading_j4bLkD": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Why Choose Small Floating Candles for Your Decor",
            "subheading_tag": "h2",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-5-base"
          }
        },
        "border_rQ6BTe": {
          "type": "border",
          "settings": {}
        },
        "text_RL4frJ": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Small floating candles may be compact, but they make a big impression. Their size offers unmatched flexibility, ideal for any space, multiple-table setups, or decorating on a budget without sacrificing style. Line them across narrow trays, scatter them in individual bowls, or cluster them for a centerpiece that draws attention.</p><p>These candles are especially handy for venues with limited space or strict decor guidelines. They provide just enough light to create ambiance without being intrusive. And because they’re lightweight, small floating candles move with the water’s surface, giving each setup a soft, natural rhythm.</p><p>Great for weddings, restaurants, and at-home entertaining, they’re a top choice when subtle detail matters. Their minimal footprint makes cleanup simple, and their burn time is just right for evening events.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "subheading_j4bLkD",
        "border_rQ6BTe",
        "text_RL4frJ"
      ],
