    "image_with_text_XriHgM": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "subheading_CaGwhC": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Perfect Floating Candles for Weddings, Parties & Home",
            "subheading_tag": "h2",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-5-base"
          }
        },
        "border_GP3KDy": {
          "type": "border",
          "settings": {}
        },
        "text_R8Dc3L": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>For event lighting, our 1.75 and 3-inch floating candles strike the perfect balance between beauty and simplicity. Their glow softens the environment, making every gathering feel more intimate. From weddings to anniversary dinners, round floating candles fit seamlessly into floral arrangements, reflecting glassware, and water features.</p><p>They’re also a favorite among event planners for their versatility. Add them to centerpieces, place them in decorative bowls along walkways, or use them in large glass cylinders to line the aisle at a ceremony. At home, a few floating candles in a bathroom or on a coffee table instantly upgrade the space without much effort.</p><p>Their unscented design keeps the focus on the visual effect, making them ideal for areas where food is served or where scent sensitivity is a concern. Whether you're designing a grand celebration or adding ambiance to a quiet night in, these candles are an easy win.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "subheading_CaGwhC",
