    "image_with_text_YFy6rM": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "subheading_4W4pwU": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "The Elegance of Floating Candles",
            "subheading_tag": "h2",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-5-base"
          }
        },
        "border_7FLkyj": {
          "type": "border",
          "settings": {}
        },
        "text_G7eEn9": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Floating candles bring a touch of magic to any setting, transforming ordinary spaces into realms of enchantment. <strong>These captivating candles can give a gentle glow at a wedding, cast romantic shadows, or provide the serene light at a dinner. </strong>At Kisco Candles, we pride ourselves on crafting candles that look beautiful while offering a clean, steady burn. Our <a href=\"https://kiscocandles.com/collections/bolsius-candles\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Bolsius candles</span></a> promise an experience free from everyday annoyances <strong>like dripping wax or unwanted scents, </strong>making every moment you light them enjoyable.</p><h2>Enjoy Free Shipping and Dedicated Customer Service</h2><p>Kisco Candles commits to delivering exceptional floating candles right to your door, free of charge, anywhere in the nation. <strong>There is no minimum to order, so you get exactly what you need.</strong> <strong>Our dedication to your satisfaction matches our passion for quality. </strong> At Kisco, every candle holds a promise of a product you'll love and a name you can trust. </p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "subheading_4W4pwU",
        "border_7FLkyj",
        "text_G7eEn9"
