        },
        "text_hUYJ6B": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Kisco’s floating candles are unmatched when creating moments of beauty and tranquility. <strong>With a focus on quality and customer satisfaction,</strong> we ensure every candle enhances your experience, burning cleanly and evenly for hours on end. Here are a few reasons that our customers enjoy  our floating candles:</p><ul><li><strong>Clean Burns:</strong> Our candles are meticulously crafted to burn without leaving waxy residue or smoke ensuring your surfaces and atmosphere remain pristine.</li><li><strong>Sublime Aesthetics: </strong>Kisco candles boast a beautiful, silent flame that provides a steady glow, perfect for setting a serene atmosphere. Our floating candles work well for the pool, in vases, and as centerpieces for your most memorable occasions.</li><li><strong>Range of Choices:</strong> From classic ivory to vibrant red, our floating candles come in colors to match your decor, ensuring you find the perfect fit for your occasion. </li><li><strong>Lasting Illumination:</strong> Designed for longevity, our candles promise extended burn time, allowing you to indulge in their ambiance well into the evening</li></ul>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        }
      },
