            "text": "<p><strong>Imagine adorning your venue with a sea of gentle lights, each candle floating effortlessly</strong>. Our range of <a href=\"https://kiscocandles.com/collections/wholesale-bulk-floating-candles\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">bulk floating candles</span></a> offers a cost-effective option for event planners and homeowners alike. </p><p>Whether you're orchestrating a <a href=\"https://www.brideandblossom.com/blog/guide-to-wedding-candles-gorgeous-ideas-for-lighting-up-your-big-day/\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">grand wedding </span></a>or hosting a large-scale event, the variety and affordability of our bulk candles <strong>ensure your space is illuminated with elegance and style </strong>without compromising on quality. </p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100"
          }
        },
        "spacer_QAyyJJ": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 28
          }
        }
      },
